The AMBE+2 quantiser tables in src/ambe_tables_fw.c are extracted from a
Baofeng DM-32UV firmware image; see tools/extract_tables.py for where each one
lives in that image and how it was located.  AMBE and AMBE+2 are trademarks of
Digital Voice Systems, Inc., and the algorithms are patented in some
jurisdictions.  This is interoperability research on a radio the author owns.
